      "text": "After breakfast, leave Colchani and travel across the southern Altiplano."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:15e148febb18421f",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "80cce9a8945f6dc5cf4716e29491bc5c045e9ffc0086ffae429d222f340d1089",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-mw6m8vuu",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Visit the old train cemetery near Uyuni, settlements in Sud Lípez and San Cristóbal, the red rock formations of the Valley of the Rocks, and the area around Ollagüe Volcano. Lunch en route. Continue to the Joyas Andinas lagoons, the “Andean jewels,” set among volcanoes and desert plains. The specific lagoons visited are confirmed at booking."
